# Empty on purpose: the API is reached at the SAME origin as the page and
# proxied to the backend by the dev server (see vite.config.js). A relative
# /api/... works on your laptop and through a shared tunnel alike, where an
# absolute http://127.0.0.1:8000 only ever works on your own machine.
#
# Set this only to point the browser straight at a backend somewhere else.
VITE_API=
